meta {
  name: QR code (PNG)
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/internal/rcs/pair/qr
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  The current pairing QR as a PNG. Open it in a browser and scan it from Google
  Messages, Device pairing, QR code scanner.

  It rotates every 30 seconds, so refresh if it has been sitting a while.
  Requires `start QR pairing` to have been called first, on the same running server.

  **Treat this image as a secret.** It embeds the session encryption keys, so
  anyone who sees it can pair as that phone. Never paste it into a ticket, a
  chat or a log.

  Errors:
  - 400 — no attempt is running, or it already finished
}
